They say that you can't get wishes using a wand of polymorph  -more-

I don't know whether this has been suggested before, but polypilers
have probably done it. I'm not into polypiling myself, but with all the
high scores, etc being bandied about I thought I'd have a go.

I found two LARGE potion shops on levels 2 and 3. Robbed them both and
got a huge pile of fairly useless potions (I quaffed the good ones).
These I zapped with my wand of polymorph. Among the resultant potions
was a glowing potion (extra healing). Quaffing this, I released a
djinni who gave me a wish. I wished for blessed scrolls of charging
to recharge my wand. 
Anyway, a few more zaps got me quite a few more glowing potions, as well
as plenty of holy water. So I blessed all the glowing potions, and
quaffed again. As well as the great hit point bonuses, I got another
wish. With this I got another wand of polymorph. This is as far as I
have got so far, but it seems the only limit is running out of potions.
All I need is more than one wish per (recharged) wand of polymorph.
Has anyone else tried this? What is the chance of getting a wish from a
blessed glowing potion?

